## 19. Frontend Requirements

Frontend can be implemented after P0 backend is stable.

Recommended stack:

```text
React
TypeScript
Vite or Next.js
Tailwind CSS
SSE client
Graph visualization library, optional
```

Core pages:

```text
1. Research Run Creation
2. Research Timeline
3. Source List
4. Evidence Graph Viewer
5. Citation Inspector
6. Report Viewer
7. Artifact Download
8. Eval Report Viewer
```

Research timeline should show:

```text
Planning
Searching
Reading
Extracting Evidence
Verifying Claims
Writing Report
Reviewing
Completed
```

