## 20. Quick Start

### 20.1 Prerequisites

Install:

- Python 3.12+
- Docker Desktop
- Node.js 22+, only if using frontend
- uv, recommended

### 20.2 Local Backend Startup

在电脑的终端 Terminal 里输入以下命令。
如果你使用 VS Code / Cursor / Codex，请先打开项目文件夹，然后在底部 Terminal 面板输入。

```bash
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd researchos

uv python install 3.12
uv venv --python 3.12

# macOS / Linux
source .venv/bin/activate

# Windows PowerShell
# .venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

uv sync --extra dev --extra test

cp .env.example .env

python -m researchos.api.main
```

Default backend URL:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

Health checks:

```text
http://localhost:8000/healthz
http://localhost:8000/readyz
http://localhost:8000/metricsz
```

### 20.3 Docker Startup

在电脑的终端 Terminal 里输入：

```bash
docker compose -f docker/compose/docker-compose.dev.yml up --build
```

Stop services:

```bash
docker compose -f docker/compose/docker-compose.dev.yml down
```

### 20.4 Run Tests

在项目根目录的终端 Terminal 里输入：

```bash
pytest tests -v
```

### 20.5 Run Eval Harness

在项目根目录的终端 Terminal 里输入：

```bash
python -m researchos.evals.harness --dataset evals/datasets/smoke_cases.jsonl
```

