## 21. Makefile Targets

Recommended Makefile targets:

```makefile
.PHONY: serve test lint format eval docker-up docker-down

serve:
	python -m researchos.api.main

test:
	pytest tests -v

lint:
	ruff check src tests

format:
	ruff format src tests

eval:
	python -m researchos.evals.harness --dataset evals/datasets/smoke_cases.jsonl

docker-up:
	docker compose -f docker/compose/docker-compose.dev.yml up --build

docker-down:
	docker compose -f docker/compose/docker-compose.dev.yml down
```

