## 22. Testing Strategy

### 22.1 Unit Tests

Test:

- Pydantic schemas
- workspace path guards
- artifact store
- event store
- source parser
- citation verifier
- evaluation metrics

### 22.2 Integration Tests

Test:

- create research run
- stream SSE events
- cancel run
- list artifacts
- download artifact
- sandbox execution
- end-to-end smoke research task

### 22.3 Regression Tests

Test:

- same dataset should not regress on core metrics
- prompt changes should be evaluated
- model routing changes should be evaluated
- retrieval changes should be evaluated

Example tests:

```text
test_research_run_lifecycle.py
test_sse_event_contract.py
test_artifact_api_contract.py
test_workspace_isolation.py
test_sandbox_policy.py
test_citation_verification.py
test_eval_harness_smoke.py
test_regression_metrics.py
```

